WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:27.200
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:35.080 --> 01:37.040
Let's see who's pretending
to be a ghost here.

02:09.479 --> 02:11.680
Lady Xue. Lady Yan.

02:11.760 --> 02:14.640
What are you doing here so late?

02:14.720 --> 02:16.320
You scared us.

02:17.200 --> 02:19.080
We thought it was Lady Huan's ghost.

02:19.160 --> 02:20.720
We cleared Lady Huan's name.

02:20.800 --> 02:22.000
She has gone to heaven.

02:22.080 --> 02:23.640
She wouldn't come back and scare us.

02:24.240 --> 02:25.800
Lady Bai.

02:25.880 --> 02:28.280
If you want to apologize,
do it during the day.

02:29.240 --> 02:31.360
I wanted to come here during the day.

02:31.440 --> 02:32.280
But…

02:34.680 --> 02:37.240
But I heard that the Huan family
wants to take this place back.

02:37.320 --> 02:39.720
And they will make trouble
at Clear Mind tomorrow.

02:39.800 --> 02:43.720
I thought it would be too late tomorrow.

02:43.800 --> 02:46.560
So, I came to worship her tonight.

02:47.400 --> 02:48.840
Wait. They…

02:51.920 --> 02:53.080
How dare they.

02:53.160 --> 02:55.160
The Huan family dares to do anything.

02:55.240 --> 02:58.600
Mr. Huan is an evil man.

02:59.240 --> 03:01.600
They are despised in the jewelry guild.

03:02.240 --> 03:03.920
They want to get every cash they can get.

03:04.520 --> 03:08.080
Zheng Wu is a shareholder of Clear Mind.

03:08.160 --> 03:11.000
Isn't the Huan family
afraid of the Zheng family?

03:11.080 --> 03:12.960
Zheng Si is dead.

03:13.760 --> 03:16.400
Su Muzhe and Clear Mind

03:16.480 --> 03:18.600
are the Zheng family's worst enemies.

03:21.320 --> 03:22.960
Don't be fooled by her.

03:23.560 --> 03:24.920
Let's pay our respects to Lady Huan.

03:27.480 --> 03:28.520
Go away.

03:31.200 --> 03:32.720
Go away.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.640
Drop the act.

03:41.280 --> 03:44.320
Lady Huan, we are here to see you.

03:47.360 --> 03:50.400
Su Muzhe offended the Zheng family.

03:51.720 --> 03:54.200
Clear Mind cannot establish
a foothold in Yangzhou,

03:54.280 --> 03:57.320
let alone do business.

03:57.400 --> 03:58.440
No.

04:00.720 --> 04:01.920
We have to leave.

04:02.000 --> 04:05.320
Are you crazy?
Is that what Lady Huan wants?

04:07.000 --> 04:10.360
Lady Huan was loyal and kind.

04:10.960 --> 04:12.680
She'll understand us.

04:14.320 --> 04:15.400
Think about it.

04:15.920 --> 04:19.040
What should we do if Clear Mind is closed?

04:19.120 --> 04:21.720
We'll lose all those years of savings.

04:21.800 --> 04:23.520
We'll disappoint our fellows.

04:55.840 --> 04:58.080
Wine is not good for your health.

04:58.160 --> 04:59.040
Stop drinking.

05:01.560 --> 05:04.520
Look at my injuries.

05:06.680 --> 05:09.280
You've lost your reputation.

05:09.880 --> 05:12.920
No one will come to my Baicaojing House.

05:13.760 --> 05:16.320
Su Muzhe. Yan Zijing.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.640
I won't let them go.

05:21.280 --> 05:23.520
Let's wait for the show tomorrow.

05:29.280 --> 05:32.960
Do you like this mother-of-pearl hairpin?

05:33.560 --> 05:34.920
The design is exquisite.

05:35.000 --> 05:36.120
Can I try it on?

05:36.200 --> 05:37.040
Okay.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.720
-Is it beautiful?
-Yeah.

05:40.800 --> 05:42.360
-How about it?
-It's beautiful.

05:42.440 --> 05:44.120
Okay, keep it for me.

05:44.200 --> 05:45.800
Do you have any other recommendations?

05:45.880 --> 05:48.280
Look at these mother-of-pearl earrings.

05:48.360 --> 05:50.480
They go well with this hairpin.

05:51.080 --> 05:52.280
Any other recommendations?

05:53.040 --> 05:53.960
Look at this one.

05:54.560 --> 05:56.280
-Or this one.
-Let me see.

05:57.160 --> 05:58.080
It's nice.

05:59.040 --> 06:00.760
What can I do for you?

06:01.280 --> 06:03.040
It's okay. We're looking around.

06:06.880 --> 06:08.200
What do you want?

06:08.880 --> 06:10.120
We're here to shop, too.

06:11.480 --> 06:12.520
Gentlemen.

06:12.600 --> 06:14.800
This lady took a fancy
to this hairpin first.

06:14.880 --> 06:16.520
Why don't you look at other hairpins?

06:16.600 --> 06:18.720
Can't I take a fancy to it?

06:18.800 --> 06:20.760
-First come, first served.
-Yeah.

06:20.840 --> 06:21.800
First come, first served?

06:21.880 --> 06:24.240
Since you like it, here you go.

06:28.240 --> 06:30.440
-It fell.
-What do you want?

06:31.040 --> 06:32.320
Back off.

06:32.920 --> 06:34.320
Miss.

06:34.400 --> 06:35.440
What are you looking at?

06:35.520 --> 06:38.840
-Let me look at you.
-Get away.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.640
-Let me look at you.
-What do you want to do?

06:40.720 --> 06:41.680
She stopped us.

06:41.760 --> 06:42.880
She's bold.

06:42.960 --> 06:45.360
I'll go to the officer.

06:45.440 --> 06:47.840
I am an officer.

06:47.920 --> 06:48.800
Come on.

06:49.520 --> 06:50.760
-Come on.
-Let go.

06:50.840 --> 06:51.800
-Help.
-Don't pull me.

06:51.880 --> 06:53.080
-Let go.
-Let go.

06:53.160 --> 06:54.480
-Let go.
-Let go.

06:54.560 --> 06:56.000
-Let go.
-Who are you?

06:56.080 --> 06:57.280
-Who are you?
-Go.

06:57.360 --> 06:58.240
Take care.

06:58.320 --> 07:00.960
Get out of here.

07:01.040 --> 07:02.560
-Look. Clear Mind's people hit me.
-Look.

07:02.640 --> 07:04.360
-Clear Mind's people hit me.
-Clear Mind's people hit me.

07:04.440 --> 07:06.720
-They hit me.
-That's not true.

07:07.520 --> 07:09.440
-They hit me.
-Nonsense. That's not true.

07:09.520 --> 07:10.680
That's not true.

07:10.760 --> 07:13.200
-They bullied us.
-Get out of here.

07:13.280 --> 07:14.120
Shame on you.

07:14.200 --> 07:15.800
It's a gangster shop.

07:15.880 --> 07:18.080
-They hit people in front of their shop.
-Mr. Huan.

07:18.680 --> 07:19.640
Stop hiding.

07:19.720 --> 07:21.040
Come out and talk to us.

07:27.560 --> 07:29.240
Why did you, Clear Mind,

07:29.320 --> 07:31.680
take Lady Huan's property?

07:34.320 --> 07:38.640
Ladies and gentlemen,
Lady Huan is my daughter.

07:38.720 --> 07:41.040
Now, she's dead.

07:41.120 --> 07:42.440
But Clear Mind

07:42.520 --> 07:45.640
hogs her shares.

07:45.720 --> 07:46.560
Nonsense!

07:46.640 --> 07:47.880
That's not yours.

07:47.960 --> 07:49.600
This is outrageous! Is it legal?

07:49.680 --> 07:50.680
What do they want?

07:50.760 --> 07:52.360
They went too far.

07:52.440 --> 07:54.360
Ladies and gentlemen, please listen to me.

07:54.440 --> 07:58.360
Lady Huan disowned the Huan family
at the Qionghua Festival.

07:58.440 --> 08:00.640
Everyone in Yangzhou knows about it.

08:00.720 --> 08:02.560
How could he come and ask
for Lady Huan's shares?

08:02.640 --> 08:05.280
Lady Huan is my daughter.

08:05.360 --> 08:07.360
It's a fact.

08:07.440 --> 08:08.720
Yeah. That's true.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.320
He's shameless.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.560
You want to snatch Lady Huan's shares.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.600
If you don't give me

08:15.680 --> 08:17.520
Lady Huan's shares,

08:17.600 --> 08:20.640
I'll kill myself here.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.160
Stop messing around.

08:22.240 --> 08:24.240
-Get up.
-That's not what this is.

08:24.320 --> 08:25.600
Clear Mind, give back his shares.

08:25.680 --> 08:27.160
That's not what this is.

08:28.200 --> 08:29.920
The Huan family is shameless.

08:30.520 --> 08:31.680
Get up.

08:32.320 --> 08:34.400
The Huan family
is used by the Zheng family.

08:35.400 --> 08:37.360
They're snobs.

08:37.440 --> 08:38.799
-Get up.
-Should we do something?

08:40.400 --> 08:42.720
The Zheng family will pay for it.

08:53.920 --> 08:56.120
-Ms. Su.
-Duanwu.

08:58.800 --> 09:00.640
Mr. Huan, do you miss your daughter?

09:01.480 --> 09:02.640
I'll send you to your daughter.

09:02.720 --> 09:04.760
Ms. Su is tough.

09:04.840 --> 09:06.320
She took an axe.

09:06.400 --> 09:08.360
-None of them are easy to deal with.
-They are tough.

09:08.440 --> 09:09.600
Do you have the cheek to see Lady Huan?

09:10.840 --> 09:12.040
Mr. Huan cheated Lady Huan

09:12.960 --> 09:15.240
out of all her money

09:15.320 --> 09:16.440
and kicked her when she was down.

09:17.480 --> 09:19.480
Lady Huan disowned you a long time ago.

09:19.560 --> 09:22.240
What qualifications do you have to come
to Clear Mind for her shares?

09:22.840 --> 09:24.000
I told you.

09:24.080 --> 09:25.760
The Huan family's shop
has long run out of business.

09:28.000 --> 09:30.080
Lady Huan was unlucky

09:31.800 --> 09:33.800
to have you as a father.

09:35.960 --> 09:37.240
But I'm not Lady Huan.

09:38.400 --> 09:39.640
I won't put up with you.

09:39.720 --> 09:40.720
I'm telling you.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.480
Clear Mind is not afraid

09:42.560 --> 09:44.560
of anything the Huan family does.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.560
Whatever you want.

09:50.520 --> 09:51.920
Everyone here

09:53.360 --> 09:54.680
is sensible.

09:54.760 --> 09:56.120
Clear Mind didn't do anything wrong.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.720
Lady Huan didn't do anything wrong.

09:59.920 --> 10:01.320
Are you still going to stay here?

10:03.160 --> 10:04.920
Get out of here, liar.

10:05.000 --> 10:07.960
Mr. Huan is shameless.

10:08.040 --> 10:10.200
The Huan family's shop is finished.

10:10.840 --> 10:14.160
All right. I won't argue with you.

10:14.240 --> 10:17.040
I'll take the money back.

10:17.120 --> 10:18.120
Wait.

10:18.640 --> 10:20.960
I'll take it back. We'll see.

10:24.480 --> 10:27.280
Mr. Zheng, Clear Mind is in trouble.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.920
Should we help them?

10:32.000 --> 10:33.520
If this were the past,

10:33.600 --> 10:36.440
Clear Mind could make me money.

10:37.680 --> 10:39.840
But Zheng Si died because of her.

10:40.400 --> 10:41.600
I have to avoid it.

10:43.120 --> 10:45.960
She's so wild. She should go through this.

10:47.560 --> 10:48.480
Let's see what happens.

10:54.800 --> 10:55.920
Ladies and gentlemen,

10:56.680 --> 10:59.760
a lot has happened to Clear Mind lately.

10:59.840 --> 11:01.280
I'm sorry

11:02.120 --> 11:03.000
for the trouble.

11:04.080 --> 11:06.880
If you want to buy Clear Mind's jewelry,

11:06.960 --> 11:08.080
I welcome you.

11:08.160 --> 11:09.480
I'll give you a discount today.

11:09.560 --> 11:11.320
-We'll give you a discount.
-Yeah.

11:11.400 --> 11:12.240
We'll give you a discount.

11:12.320 --> 11:13.320
Go in and have a look.

11:14.160 --> 11:15.360
Have a look.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.840
-Miss.
-Miss.

11:16.920 --> 11:18.040
-Go in and have a look.
-Thank you. Maybe next time.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.440
-Sir, go in and have a look.
-No.

11:20.520 --> 11:21.960
The jewelry is beautiful. Have a look.

11:22.040 --> 11:23.160
-Have a look.
-Sir, we have new jewelry.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.320
-No, thanks.
-Miss,

11:24.400 --> 11:26.400
-would you like to go in and have a look?
-Maybe next time.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.520
-Go in and have a look.
-Miss.

11:28.600 --> 11:29.720
Go in and have a look.

11:29.800 --> 11:31.080
Miss, go in and have a look.

11:31.160 --> 11:32.800
Our jewelry is beautiful.

11:32.880 --> 11:33.880
-Go in and have a look.
-Go in and have a look.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.960
Please go in.

11:35.560 --> 11:36.720
-Ms. Su.
-Miss.

11:36.800 --> 11:37.920
Go in and have a look.

11:39.520 --> 11:40.440
Miss.

11:40.520 --> 11:41.680
Miss.

11:41.760 --> 11:42.600
Have a look.

11:42.680 --> 11:43.520
Go in and have a look.

11:44.720 --> 11:45.920
Miss.

11:46.000 --> 11:47.080
-We have new jewelry.
-We have new jewelry.

11:47.160 --> 11:48.160
Go in and have a look.

11:49.640 --> 11:50.800
-Let's talk inside.
-Miss.

12:11.720 --> 12:13.280
I'll be blunt.

12:13.360 --> 12:14.240
Ms. Su.

12:14.840 --> 12:16.960
What's going on?

12:17.840 --> 12:19.560
We saw it.

12:19.640 --> 12:20.720
There's always someone coming here
to make trouble.

12:21.320 --> 12:22.560
If it goes on like this,

12:22.640 --> 12:24.680
we can't do business anymore.

12:27.120 --> 12:29.200
It's our hard-earned money.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.120
Lady Huan just died.

12:34.000 --> 12:35.760
Give me some days to figure it out.

12:35.840 --> 12:38.520
The Huan family
insisted on getting Lady Huan's share.

12:38.600 --> 12:40.840
What else can you do but give him money?

12:40.920 --> 12:43.000
-But just now…
-Ms. Su.

12:43.080 --> 12:44.840
We put all our money

12:44.920 --> 12:46.680
into Clear Mind

12:46.760 --> 12:47.920
because of Lady Huan.

12:48.000 --> 12:50.840
Now, Lady Huan is dead.

12:50.920 --> 12:53.920
Although we have found the murderer,

12:54.440 --> 12:57.440
we have a lot going on here.

12:57.520 --> 12:58.800
Ms. Su.

12:59.640 --> 13:02.120
We want the money we invested back.

13:02.880 --> 13:03.800
Lady Yan…

13:04.320 --> 13:05.240
Yingtao.

13:10.800 --> 13:12.400
You're here to withdraw your shares.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.120
You're here to withdraw your shares?

13:24.040 --> 13:26.120
Do you think Clear Mind
can't be sustained,

13:27.440 --> 13:29.520
and I can't pay you back?

13:29.600 --> 13:32.640
Miss, how can you do this?

13:32.720 --> 13:34.400
Ms. Su is nice to us.

13:34.480 --> 13:36.080
She gives us
a lot of dividends every month.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.960
Duanwu won't do that to you.

13:38.040 --> 13:39.400
Please rest assured.

13:40.000 --> 13:41.120
Lady Xue.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.280
Yingtao.

13:43.360 --> 13:45.560
Do you know who she offended?

13:46.280 --> 13:47.600
Reasonably,

13:47.680 --> 13:50.480
we shouldn't give you a hard time
as Lady Huan just died.

13:50.560 --> 13:53.440
We want to have income after retirement.

13:53.520 --> 13:55.320
So, we don't need to worry
about making a living.

13:55.400 --> 13:56.560
But Ms. Su…

13:56.640 --> 13:58.520
The person you offended

13:58.600 --> 14:01.040
is too powerful.

14:01.120 --> 14:03.480
We're just songstresses.

14:03.560 --> 14:05.400
We worry about our lives.

14:05.480 --> 14:07.880
We can't afford to lose this money.

14:08.480 --> 14:10.200
What if we don't get dividends?

14:11.280 --> 14:13.440
What if we lose our lives for it?

14:13.520 --> 14:14.840
I understand your situation.

14:16.880 --> 14:19.000
I also understand
the situation of Clear Mind.

14:20.880 --> 14:22.280
But I don't understand

14:23.720 --> 14:25.840
why you think
that I would treat you badly.

14:25.920 --> 14:28.360
We're lucky to know each other.

14:28.440 --> 14:29.320
How about this?

14:30.120 --> 14:31.400
We'll give you ten days.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.320
Please give us a reply

14:33.840 --> 14:35.960
within ten days.

14:36.560 --> 14:39.080
-Lady Yan.
-Lady Yan.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.320
Lady Yan.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.920
We can't get the money in ten days.

14:43.760 --> 14:44.880
Miss.

14:44.960 --> 14:47.120
-Please don't do this.
-Lady Xue.

14:48.920 --> 14:49.760
Ms. Su.

14:51.920 --> 14:53.040
You are a good girl.

14:53.640 --> 14:54.600
I'm sorry…

14:57.360 --> 14:58.560
for this.

15:00.720 --> 15:01.560
Lady Xue.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.480
Come with me.

15:06.040 --> 15:06.880
I'm not leaving.

15:07.680 --> 15:10.560
It's not easy for Ms. Su
to run Clear Mind on her own.

15:10.640 --> 15:11.840
I can't leave.

15:16.280 --> 15:17.480
It's up to you.

15:29.120 --> 15:30.000
Duanwu.

15:30.720 --> 15:31.560
It's okay.

15:32.720 --> 15:33.800
Let's close the shop first.

16:07.840 --> 16:09.200
Mr. Zheng, what do you

16:09.720 --> 16:10.720
want to see me about?

16:11.480 --> 16:12.800
I'm here to buy rubies.

16:14.120 --> 16:16.840
Master Yan, name your price.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.920
Kang Ju, bring all the rubies.

16:31.560 --> 16:32.480
Here.

16:37.880 --> 16:39.880
Here are all the rubies in Yangzhou.

16:40.480 --> 16:42.600
They come in different sizes and grades.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.120
But I don't sell them in retail.

16:45.000 --> 16:46.000
It's

16:47.040 --> 16:47.880
80 million mace in total.

16:56.160 --> 16:58.440
Master Yan…

16:59.720 --> 17:00.880
Won't you reconsider?

17:03.800 --> 17:05.319
No, I won't.

17:05.920 --> 17:09.119
All right. The Zheng family
will take them all.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.920
Someone will come and trade later.

17:14.800 --> 17:17.839
I will repay you later.

17:19.280 --> 17:20.400
Excuse me.

17:41.880 --> 17:42.760
Not too bad.

17:43.600 --> 17:44.760
Not too bad.

17:46.400 --> 17:47.520
Yingtao, are you okay?

17:50.880 --> 17:52.680
Yingtao, talk to me.

17:53.400 --> 17:55.160
I went out for something.

17:55.760 --> 17:56.840
Please talk to me.

17:58.080 --> 17:59.200
Where did you go?

17:59.800 --> 18:01.240
My cousin

18:01.320 --> 18:03.640
lost a cockfight today.

18:03.720 --> 18:05.280
The other party cheated.

18:05.360 --> 18:06.800
He called me over to help him.

18:06.880 --> 18:09.040
I had a fight with them.
I fought against ten people.

18:09.120 --> 18:10.920
There was an accident at Clear Mind.
But you fought.

18:11.760 --> 18:12.960
What did you promise me?

18:13.040 --> 18:14.560
What did you promise Ms. Su?

18:14.640 --> 18:15.720
I swear

18:15.800 --> 18:17.760
I'll never go out again.

18:19.440 --> 18:20.520
Do you mean it?

18:24.640 --> 18:25.480
Yes.

18:28.200 --> 18:31.040
There was an incident at Clear Mind.

18:31.120 --> 18:32.840
Ms. Su took an axe.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.080
But you were not there.

18:36.960 --> 18:39.360
What if something had happened
to Clear Mind?

18:39.440 --> 18:40.880
What if something had happened to Ms. Su?

18:41.440 --> 18:44.360
Don't say that, Yingtao.

18:46.160 --> 18:47.640
I will guard Clear Mind.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.400
I won't let it happen again.

18:52.080 --> 18:53.360
Do you promise?

18:53.960 --> 18:54.920
I promise you

18:56.160 --> 18:57.000
it won't happen again.

21:00.760 --> 21:01.600
Duanwu.

21:16.040 --> 21:17.000
Duanwu.

21:17.880 --> 21:19.080
You didn't sleep all night again.

21:27.240 --> 21:29.560
Duanwu, I just came back
from the Jade Ward.

21:30.800 --> 21:33.200
They're having
a jade competition tomorrow.

21:33.280 --> 21:35.160
If I win, not only do I get money,

21:35.240 --> 21:37.280
but I get publicity for Clear Mind.

21:38.640 --> 21:39.480
I want to have a try.

21:47.680 --> 21:48.560
Okay.

21:50.120 --> 21:51.320
I'll go with you.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.440
Duanwu.

21:58.800 --> 21:59.880
I can do it myself.

22:11.560 --> 22:12.400
Shiqi.

22:17.760 --> 22:19.000
Am I useless?

22:27.200 --> 22:29.200
Don't be so stressed.

22:29.760 --> 22:32.560
I've always been there for you.

22:39.520 --> 22:41.120
Get some rest.

23:21.120 --> 23:22.240
It's of medium quality.

23:23.480 --> 23:25.920
This one is good.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.800
Its color is great.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.560
It's a pity that it has a flaw.

23:34.640 --> 23:37.120
Its flaw is on the surface.

23:37.200 --> 23:38.760
Is there a flaw on the inside?

23:38.840 --> 23:39.680
It's hard to tell.

23:39.760 --> 23:42.640
Sir, can I have a look?

23:43.520 --> 23:44.400
Who are you?

23:44.480 --> 23:46.400
Yue Yunxiu, Master Artisan of Clear Mind.

23:46.480 --> 23:47.600
Did you hear it?

23:47.680 --> 23:50.160
Mr. Huan went to Su Muzhe
and asked her for money.

23:50.240 --> 23:52.120
Clear Mind is going out of business.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.720
Of course, they are idle.

23:53.800 --> 23:54.960
Yeah.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.960
Miss.

23:57.040 --> 23:58.760
You've been watching
and touching it for a while.

23:58.840 --> 24:00.240
Did you get anything?

24:00.840 --> 24:03.040
Miss, what's your idea?

24:03.120 --> 24:05.160
This jade is delicate in texture.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.880
It can be made into a lotus crown.

24:06.960 --> 24:08.240
Make the flaw into stamens and pistils.

24:08.320 --> 24:09.600
It's a large piece of jade.

24:09.680 --> 24:11.520
Who would wear such a heavy crown?

24:11.600 --> 24:12.800
Hollow it

24:12.880 --> 24:14.760
to make the carcass as thin as paper.

24:14.840 --> 24:16.000
Then, polish it

24:16.080 --> 24:18.120
to make it crystal clear.

24:18.200 --> 24:20.600
The eggshell technique is difficult.

24:20.680 --> 24:22.240
There should be no dead ends inside,

24:22.320 --> 24:24.480
and the outside should be evenly thick.

24:24.560 --> 24:25.920
You'll need ten of these materials

24:26.000 --> 24:28.040
to make a round vessel,

24:28.120 --> 24:29.800
not to mention this material.

24:29.880 --> 24:32.000
You have to be careful
every time you carve.

24:32.080 --> 24:35.520
Not to mention,
you want to make it into a lotus crown.

24:35.600 --> 24:37.040
I can give it a try.

24:37.120 --> 24:38.840
Do you really know how to carve jade?

24:38.920 --> 24:40.360
I have been carving jade
since I was a kid.

24:40.440 --> 24:41.960
I cherish jade.

24:42.680 --> 24:43.800
I'm sure I can make it.

24:45.400 --> 24:47.600
Boss, you are so brave.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.520
I can't believe you let her try.

24:49.600 --> 24:51.840
Aren't you afraid that she will waste
this piece of nice jade?

24:51.920 --> 24:52.800
Yeah.

24:52.880 --> 24:54.120
You don't know her.

24:54.200 --> 24:55.920
You're being silly.

25:13.840 --> 25:15.400
As long as Shiqi has jade in her hands,

25:16.680 --> 25:18.440
she seems

25:19.040 --> 25:20.720
to have no other thoughts.

25:23.200 --> 25:24.120
That's what

25:26.440 --> 25:28.000
makes her who she is.

25:30.760 --> 25:32.280
We must stay in Yangzhou.

25:32.880 --> 25:34.120
I'm waiting for you here

25:34.880 --> 25:36.080
to tell you

25:37.040 --> 25:38.040
that I will stay

25:39.640 --> 25:40.480
in Yangzhou.

25:40.560 --> 25:42.120
If you lose once,

25:42.720 --> 25:44.320
you'll lose everything.

25:44.880 --> 25:46.240
I've had nothing for a long time.

25:46.840 --> 25:49.080
Lady Huan made Clear Mind famous

25:49.160 --> 25:50.840
at the Qionghua Festival.

25:52.120 --> 25:53.240
Since I'll open a shop,

25:56.000 --> 25:58.520
I'll open it in a popular place.

26:00.840 --> 26:02.800
Clear Mind is where it is today

26:04.120 --> 26:06.200
because I thought too much

26:07.000 --> 26:08.240
and rushed.

26:11.760 --> 26:14.680
Osmanthus cake.
Sweet and tender osmanthus cake.

26:14.760 --> 26:16.200
Have a look.

26:17.640 --> 26:18.840
Osmanthus cake.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.760
Sweet and tender osmanthus cake.

26:20.840 --> 26:22.600
Is the Tanghulu delicious?

26:22.680 --> 26:23.680
Yes.

26:25.320 --> 26:27.320
-Father.
-I don't like it. You eat it.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.480
You're good.
I'll make you something delicious.

26:32.600 --> 26:34.240
Osmanthus cake.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.360
Osmanthus cake.

26:35.920 --> 26:38.200
Sweet and tender osmanthus cake.

26:38.280 --> 26:39.400
Have a look.

26:39.480 --> 26:41.600
A merchant

26:41.680 --> 26:42.760
is unrestrained and free.

26:48.440 --> 26:52.120
Duanwu. What do we name our shop?

26:52.720 --> 26:54.320
May my heart be as bright as the moon.

26:56.040 --> 26:57.720
So I can see through people.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.840
Clear Mind.

27:01.520 --> 27:02.880
Ladies.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.280
Don't you have any jewelry you like?

27:04.360 --> 27:06.120
It's a big shop,
but there are very few things.

27:06.200 --> 27:07.400
It's shabby.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.920
This shop is about to close.

27:09.000 --> 27:10.280
I wanted my heart
to be as bright as the moon.

27:10.960 --> 27:12.800
I wanted to see through people.

27:14.400 --> 27:16.160
But I didn't see through myself.

27:17.200 --> 27:19.560
I was so eager to prove myself.

27:20.520 --> 27:22.280
I'm running out of money.

27:22.360 --> 27:24.040
My jewelry is normal.

27:25.800 --> 27:27.280
Clear Mind

27:28.600 --> 27:30.560
can't stand the twists and turns now.

27:30.640 --> 27:31.480
Duanwu.

27:34.760 --> 27:35.600
Everything will be fine.

27:58.760 --> 28:00.520
You've been looking at the files
all night.

28:00.600 --> 28:01.960
And you met so many people.

28:02.040 --> 28:02.880
It's late.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.120
Rest early.

28:04.200 --> 28:06.160
There's something wrong
with Zheng Zhixing's confession.

28:08.320 --> 28:10.520
He put all the blame

28:12.000 --> 28:14.200
on the Cui family.

28:16.400 --> 28:19.040
We asked the servants of the Cui family.

28:19.760 --> 28:20.960
They all said that the Cui family
was out of money.

28:21.040 --> 28:22.960
If the Cui family had
the Black Dragon Bandits' stolen goods,

28:24.080 --> 28:25.880
Cui Jingchu would have taken a risk
and sold them.

28:25.960 --> 28:28.200
He wouldn't have mortgaged
Zhenlang Pavilion to Yan Zijing

28:28.280 --> 28:31.520
because of financial problems.

28:32.120 --> 28:34.480
It was not the Cui family

28:36.640 --> 28:37.600
who sold
the Black Dragon Bandits' stolen goods.

28:38.600 --> 28:39.440
It was the Zheng family.

28:40.120 --> 28:41.200
Prince Ying told you

28:41.800 --> 28:43.080
not to investigate this case.

28:44.800 --> 28:45.640
Xu Nanying

28:47.080 --> 28:49.200
was Prince Tan's faithful servant.

28:49.280 --> 28:51.560
He returned to Chang'an with sin.

28:52.320 --> 28:53.920
Then, he became

28:54.000 --> 28:56.160
the official
of the Yangzhou Governor's Office.

28:57.520 --> 28:59.000
It's the most important position
in the southeast.

29:01.000 --> 29:03.280
He had nothing to do
with the Zheng family.

29:05.120 --> 29:06.920
But he spoke for them

29:07.480 --> 29:08.920
at the interrogation.

29:09.520 --> 29:11.080
We can't deal with Prince Ying.

29:11.920 --> 29:14.240
And you are sworn brothers.

29:15.000 --> 29:16.400
If this is what you think it is,

29:16.480 --> 29:18.320
what should you do?

29:52.560 --> 29:55.320
Looks like Clear Mind is going to close.

29:56.000 --> 29:58.560
It's useless to pray to the Bodhisattva.

29:59.160 --> 30:01.920
A Bodhisattva will not bless
a wicked person.

30:02.000 --> 30:03.720
You'd better

30:03.800 --> 30:05.640
stay away from Wu.

30:05.720 --> 30:06.880
Don't approach him.

30:07.840 --> 30:09.080
About Si's matter,

30:09.680 --> 30:11.280
my master didn't deal with you
on the spot.

30:11.360 --> 30:12.840
We were kind to you.

30:12.920 --> 30:15.520
How can Wu be entangled with you?

30:15.600 --> 30:17.400
You're smart.

30:17.480 --> 30:19.200
You should know what to do.

30:26.960 --> 30:28.160
Su Muzhe, are you dumb?

30:28.240 --> 30:29.680
My lady is talking to you.

30:31.040 --> 30:33.080
I'm here to mourn Lady Huan.

30:36.160 --> 30:37.160
Lady Yu.

30:38.400 --> 30:40.480
You'd better show some respect.

30:41.560 --> 30:43.720
She was just a songstress.

30:43.800 --> 30:46.440
You forgot you used to be a songstress.

30:48.800 --> 30:50.080
Su Muzhe.

30:50.160 --> 30:51.520
Zheng Si

30:51.600 --> 30:53.000
deserved

30:53.520 --> 30:54.840
to die.

30:56.520 --> 30:59.120
Lady Yu, you're happy.

30:59.200 --> 31:02.720
Why did you pretend to be kind
in front of the Bodhisattva?

31:09.600 --> 31:10.520
Lady.

31:22.080 --> 31:25.320
You've been away for over a year.

31:25.920 --> 31:26.960
Thank you for caring about me.

31:27.040 --> 31:30.160
Here's some tea. Drink it.

31:30.240 --> 31:31.280
Thank you.

31:31.360 --> 31:35.400
Jinran, I had to do this.

31:35.480 --> 31:36.720
I collected all the calligraphy,
paintings,

31:36.800 --> 31:39.200
and books in the room.

31:39.280 --> 31:40.960
I'll give them to you.

31:41.040 --> 31:42.280
Please forgive me.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.360
Ms. Su.

31:51.160 --> 31:52.200
Duanwu.

31:53.680 --> 31:54.720
Come here.

31:58.240 --> 31:59.760
Mr. Zhang, what are you doing here?

32:00.560 --> 32:01.640
Have a seat.

32:07.920 --> 32:08.960
I'm here

32:09.520 --> 32:12.160
to listen to the bells
and smell the incense.

32:13.000 --> 32:15.680
It calms me.

32:17.600 --> 32:18.640
What are you doing here?

32:19.160 --> 32:20.520
I'm here to light incense for Lady Huan.

32:25.080 --> 32:28.280
It's good to calm down.

32:30.960 --> 32:33.600
Are you upset about Clear Mind?

32:35.000 --> 32:36.200
How do you know that?

32:37.160 --> 32:38.280
Did something happen

32:39.720 --> 32:40.840
to Clear Mind?

32:43.400 --> 32:45.520
Clear Mind has no foundation.

32:46.680 --> 32:48.280
I don't know

32:50.440 --> 32:51.600
what to do

32:52.200 --> 32:53.960
to help Clear Mind
to gain a foothold in Yangzhou.

32:56.000 --> 32:57.320
Clear Mind

32:58.120 --> 33:00.160
can't slowly accumulate resources

33:01.200 --> 33:02.680
like other shops.

33:04.280 --> 33:07.000
You can't expect
other jewelry shops to help you.

33:07.840 --> 33:09.400
You should stay true
to your original mission.

33:10.960 --> 33:13.200
You should do the simplest thing.

33:13.800 --> 33:14.920
Think about it.

33:15.480 --> 33:16.600
What do you want to do most

33:17.120 --> 33:18.680
for all this time?

33:28.480 --> 33:29.760
What do I want to do most?

33:38.200 --> 33:39.280
Do you have an idea?

33:52.800 --> 33:54.160
Mr. Zhang.

33:55.720 --> 33:57.760
Are you here
to seek your original mission?

34:01.280 --> 34:03.120
From investigating cases in Hepu

34:04.160 --> 34:05.400
to now,

34:07.600 --> 34:09.880
things are connected.

34:12.199 --> 34:13.800
The case is getting clearer.

34:15.600 --> 34:16.679
But I'm scared now.

34:17.800 --> 34:19.440
Yan Zijing once asked me,

34:19.520 --> 34:21.480
"If you find out the truth,

34:22.120 --> 34:24.719
will you be able to remain the same?"

34:25.280 --> 34:27.000
I told him

34:27.840 --> 34:31.480
that I would be fair no matter what.

34:32.320 --> 34:34.040
But now, I'm in a dilemma.

34:35.440 --> 34:36.480
Sometimes

34:37.560 --> 34:38.840
I think about relationships,

34:42.560 --> 34:43.880
and I can't do anything.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.600
Mr. Zhang,

34:46.600 --> 34:47.880
you seem

34:48.400 --> 34:49.480
to be hesitating.

34:52.400 --> 34:54.199
But it seems to me

34:56.159 --> 34:57.720
that you have made your decision.

34:58.480 --> 35:00.720
You went from Hepu to Hexi.

35:01.440 --> 35:03.400
You went from Chang'an to Yangzhou.

35:04.400 --> 35:05.880
You already have the answer.

35:11.080 --> 35:12.120
Yes.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.720
Thank you, Duanwu.

35:27.360 --> 35:30.480
I have to go.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.000
In Hepu,

35:36.760 --> 35:39.800
you told me
that you wanted to be a free peddler.

35:39.880 --> 35:42.800
Now, you opened Clear Mind in Yangzhou

35:42.880 --> 35:43.920
and became Ms. Su.

35:45.520 --> 35:46.560
I'm happy for you.

35:49.200 --> 35:50.560
You are Su Muzhe in the eyes of others.

35:52.600 --> 35:53.800
But I understand

35:54.880 --> 35:57.320
how much Duanwu has suffered
along the way.

36:01.560 --> 36:02.800
You must be tired.

36:04.640 --> 36:08.200
I want to say that no matter what happens,

36:09.680 --> 36:11.480
I'm there for you.

36:13.440 --> 36:14.440
I can protect you.

36:19.840 --> 36:21.360
I don't want to tie you down.

36:21.960 --> 36:22.920
If you don't mind,

36:24.360 --> 36:25.760
from today on,

36:27.560 --> 36:28.760
you can think of me as your brother.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.760
Father.

36:58.280 --> 37:00.200
Although we made
the Red Leaf Crown in time,

37:00.800 --> 37:02.520
Yan Zijing asked

37:03.720 --> 37:05.240
for 80 million mace.

37:06.760 --> 37:09.000
Deliver the Red Leaf Crown
to Chang'an in time.

37:09.760 --> 37:11.400
We'll talk about it after that.

37:11.920 --> 37:12.760
Yes.

37:14.880 --> 37:18.000
Father, Yan Zijing is pressing us hard.

37:18.080 --> 37:19.640
Is he really a remnant of the Yan family?

37:20.400 --> 37:23.000
What was the Yan's case about?

37:25.000 --> 37:27.680
Father. Zhang Jinran is investigating
this old case.

37:27.760 --> 37:29.520
I'm the only one in the Zheng family
who can help you.

37:30.120 --> 37:31.520
Why don't you tell me about it?

37:31.600 --> 37:33.320
So I can be prepared

37:33.400 --> 37:34.680
to deal with it later.

37:56.120 --> 37:57.720
Where should I start?

38:02.480 --> 38:05.320
The Yan family came from the West.

38:05.400 --> 38:07.800
They have a lot of money
and countless jewels.

38:07.880 --> 38:10.640
They fought against
local jewelry merchants.

38:10.720 --> 38:13.360
The Yangzhou Jewelry Guild lost.

38:14.720 --> 38:16.920
The Yan family became

38:17.000 --> 38:18.840
the guild lead.

38:19.440 --> 38:21.680
They were targeted by two nobles
in the capital

38:22.200 --> 38:24.680
for flaunting their wealth.

38:26.000 --> 38:27.520
Since they were nobles in the capital,

38:27.600 --> 38:30.640
it should have been easy for them
to deal with the Yan family.

38:31.240 --> 38:33.960
They didn't want to do it themselves.

38:35.080 --> 38:37.880
The Yan family escorted Kang
to present tributes.

38:37.960 --> 38:40.880
The Cui family and the Zheng
jointly hired the Black Dragon Bandits.

38:40.960 --> 38:42.680
They almost wiped out the Yan family.

38:42.760 --> 38:45.760
But they deliberately
let the mission escape.

38:46.560 --> 38:50.720
And they replaced the tribute pearl.

38:52.120 --> 38:55.120
The tribute pearl shattered
in front of the Emperor.

38:55.200 --> 38:58.240
The Kang's mission was expelled.

38:58.320 --> 39:01.200
It is said that they were killed
on their way back.

39:01.280 --> 39:03.520
The Yan family, who was slaughtered
by the Black Dragon Bandits,

39:04.520 --> 39:08.040
was convicted

39:08.120 --> 39:09.240
by the Imperial Court.

39:10.000 --> 39:12.360
Their jewelry was confiscated.
Their property was auctioned.

39:13.200 --> 39:18.240
The property was given to the two nobles.

39:18.320 --> 39:20.440
Then, the Cui family
and the Zheng family divided the rest.

39:21.560 --> 39:24.720
The Cui family and the Zheng family
were partners.

39:25.320 --> 39:29.400
But the Cui family went the wrong way.

39:30.440 --> 39:33.000
That's why they ended up
where they are today.

39:42.760 --> 39:43.600
Wu.

39:45.160 --> 39:46.720
About Si's death,

39:48.240 --> 39:50.440
you may think I'm cruel.

39:53.760 --> 39:55.840
But the Zheng family can't afford

39:57.280 --> 39:58.480
to make any mistakes.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.800
I understand.

40:02.520 --> 40:03.880
If he's a remnant of the Yan family,

40:04.880 --> 40:06.000
we'll kill him.

40:08.440 --> 40:10.200
Don't act rashly.

40:11.240 --> 40:13.520
It's not easy to kill a man.

40:14.120 --> 40:15.800
Don't forget Si.

40:19.200 --> 40:20.400
Test him first.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.280
Test him?

40:23.800 --> 40:27.160
Test him with the Black Dragon Bandits.

40:35.760 --> 40:37.320
Gaoshou, Yingtao.

40:37.400 --> 40:39.200
I can't lose Clear Mind.

40:39.800 --> 40:43.480
I have a favor to ask you.

40:44.080 --> 40:46.160
Jewelry guild is working together
to suppress our Clear Mind

40:46.240 --> 40:47.400
and cut off all our supplies.

40:48.000 --> 40:49.600
If we want to get out of their grip,

40:50.360 --> 40:51.720
we have to buy supplies from other cities.

40:54.920 --> 40:55.920
So, you have to go to Guangzhou.

40:57.760 --> 40:59.280
I have a friend in Guangzhou.

41:00.920 --> 41:02.360
I want to transfer goods from her.

41:02.960 --> 41:04.720
We have glass,

41:04.800 --> 41:06.520
but we don't have gold and raw stones.

41:06.600 --> 41:08.280
We can't make jewelry.

41:08.360 --> 41:09.480
It's important

41:10.360 --> 41:11.760
to get gold and raw stones.

41:15.080 --> 41:18.560
Here's all the money Clear Mind has left.

41:19.200 --> 41:22.080
-Um…
-You take it and go to Guangzhou.

41:22.160 --> 41:23.840
Give it to my friend, Wu.

41:26.760 --> 41:27.920
And this.

41:28.000 --> 41:29.520
This is my letter to her.

41:29.600 --> 41:30.560
It's an IOU.

41:32.280 --> 41:33.520
Plead with her.

41:34.920 --> 41:37.160
Remember. If she doesn't want to help me,

41:38.160 --> 41:39.120
don't force it.

41:39.760 --> 41:40.800
Rest assured, Ms. Su.

41:40.880 --> 41:43.000
We will do our best.

41:44.280 --> 41:45.400
Ms. Su, rest assured.

41:46.080 --> 41:49.760
CLEAR MIND

41:51.840 --> 41:53.400
Be careful on the road.

41:56.920 --> 41:58.200
Don't worry, Ms. Su.

41:58.280 --> 41:59.120
You…

42:00.040 --> 42:00.880
Take care.

42:04.520 --> 42:05.640
Thank you, Gaoshou.

42:08.640 --> 42:11.880
Ms. Su, I'm leaving.

42:13.520 --> 42:17.040
Yunxiu, take care.

42:28.520 --> 42:29.640
Don't worry, Ms. Su.

42:31.280 --> 42:32.520
Go.
